    "testingNotes": "Build 60 \u2014 latest beta feedback fixes\n\n\u2022 Share everything: open a listing and send its tour, photos, verified retained originals when available, disclosure notes, reels, aerial clips and listing details as one ZIP or separate files.\n\u2022 Get started: with two or more existing homes, choose Start a new home and name the new listing.\n\u2022 Reels: validation or allowance refusals no longer leave Generate stuck. Timeouts and already-started responses retain the saved request to prevent another paid submission.\n\u2022 Sold listings: equivalent timestamp formats no longer keep facts waiting to sync.\n\u2022 Aerial intro now sits beside Re-render fly-through.\n\u2022 Server deletion and reel-accounting fixes are already live.\n\nPlease check deleting/restoring a test listing, opening the full ZIP, creating a new home from Get started, and generating a reel. Republish was confirmed working in build 59 feedback. Measurements and 3D remain Coming soon. This is an internal TestFlight update; the App Store submission stays on build 57 with manual release.\n",
